; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_WindowShowModal
; 說明 ...: Shows a window as a non-blocking modal window by establishing Win32 ownership and disabling the owner until
;                  the modal window is hidden or closed.
; 語法 ........: _UI_WindowShowModal( $hWnd, $hOwner )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $hOwner - Required valid owner window handle; cannot be 0 or equal to $hWnd
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1
;                  Failure - 0; the window/owner is invalid, the owner relationship is in a loop, or the window has been bound
;                  to other modal owners.
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: Multiple modal windows can share the same owner; the last one is hidden/closed and restored to its original
;                  enabled state by owner. Displaying the same window with the same owner repeatedly is idempotent.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_WindowHide, _UI_WindowClose, _UI_WindowShow
; 範例 .......: No
; ===============================================================================================================================
