; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_BeginUpdate
; 說明 ...: Begins a batched update and defers layout until the matching _UI_EndUpdate call. This combines repeated
;                  full-tree layouts into one final layout when many controls are created. Calls may be nested.
; 語法 ........: _UI_BeginUpdate( $hWnd )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1
;                  Failure - 0
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_EndUpdate
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
