; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iId - Target element ID; Popover user switch returns 1/0, Drawer user point mask off returns 0; DataView
;                  returns the clicked row number (0-based), or -1 when clicking blank space clears the selection
