;                  Failure - 0
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: May be read while the transfer is still running once response headers have arrived; use @error to distinguish
;                  not-ready state from a valid return value.
; 範例 .......: No
; ===============================================================================================================================
Func _UI_HttpRequestGetStatusCode($iRequestId)
    Local $vAuiForwardResult = __AUI_Call("int", "_UI_HttpRequestGetStatusCode", "int", $iRequestId)
