; 名稱 ..........: _UI_AsyncResult
; 說明 ...: Retrieves the result string of a completed asynchronous task.
; 語法 ........: _UI_AsyncResult( $iTaskId )
; 參數 ....: $iTaskId - The task ID received by the current completion callback
; 傳回值 .: Success - Task result string
;                  Failure - Empty string with @error set; @error is $AUI_ERR_OUT_OF_RANGE when the task ID is unknown or the
;                  result was already reclaimed
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: The result is only valid during the execution of the task's completion callback, and the task is recycled
;                  after the callback returns.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_HttpRequestCreate, _UI_FileHashAsync, _UI_DirScanAsync
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
