; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_ShowPerfHud
; 說明 ...: Switches performance HUD (real-time display in the upper right corner of the window, ms and fps taken to
;                  build each frame).
; 語法 ........: _UI_ShowPerfHud( $hWnd [, $bShow = True] )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $bShow - [Optional] True=show, False=hide (default True)
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1
;                  Failure - 0
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: For development and debugging only. Turning on will force the entire window to redraw and maintain a ~30fps
;                  timer to facilitate observation of performance during scrolling/interaction; turn it off before publishing.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_GetPaintMs
; 範例 .......: No
; ===============================================================================================================================
Func _UI_ShowPerfHud($hWnd, $bShow = True)
    Local $vAuiForwardResult = __AUI_Call("int", "_UI_ShowPerfHud", "hwnd", $hWnd, "int", $bShow)
    Return SetError(@error, @extended, $vAuiForwardResult)
EndFunc

