; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_PanelSetElevated
; 說明 ...: Sets whether the panel uses theme high-level background and shadow.
; 語法 ........: _UI_PanelSetElevated( $hWnd, $iPanel [, $bElevated = True] )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iPanel - _UI_Panel panel ID returned
;                  $bElevated - [Optional] True to enable high-level appearance, False to turn off, default True
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1
;                  Failure - 0
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
