; 名稱 ..........: _UI_ButtonSetLoading
; 說明 ...: Sets the loading state of a normal button or an icon button.
; 語法 ........: _UI_ButtonSetLoading( $hWnd, $iButton, $bLoading )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
