; 備註 .......: Silently selects the next available tab when disabling the current tab; disabled tabs cannot be activated.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_TabsGetItemEnabled, _UI_TabsSetSelected
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
