; 說明 ...: Enables or disable specified path levels.
; 語法 ........: _UI_BreadcrumbSetItemEnabled( $hWnd, $iBreadcrumb, $iIndex, $bEnabled )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
