; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_DataViewGetCell
; 說明 ...: Retrieves the text of a certain cell in the DataView.
; 語法 ........: _UI_DataViewGetCell( $hWnd, $iDataViewId, $iRow, $iCol [, $iBufSize = 0] )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iDataViewId - DataView element ID returned by _UI_DataView
;                  $iRow - Line number (starting from 0)
;                  $iCol - Column number (starting from 0)
;                  $iBufSize - [Optional] Minimum number of characters in the receive buffer; when the default is 0, it is
