; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_DataViewOnCellClick
; 說明 ...: Registers cell click callback Func(row, column). A callback will be made on which cell is clicked (different
;                  from row selection: row selection uses _UI_OnValue). Used for clickable grid/inline actions/link columns.
;                  Only triggered by mouse click (not triggered by keyboard selection).
; 語法 ........: _UI_DataViewOnCellClick( $hWnd, $iDataView, $sFuncName )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iDataView - DataView control ID
;                  $sFuncName - Callback function name; pass an empty string to unregister the callback
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1
;                  Failure - 0; the callback name is invalid, callback registration failed, or the native call failed
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 範例 .......: No
; ===============================================================================================================================
Func _UI_DataViewOnCellClick($hWnd, $iDataView, $sFuncName)
	If __AUI_ValidateOptionalCallback($sFuncName) = 0 Then Return SetError(@error, 0, 0)
	If $sFuncName <> "" And $g_pAuiDispCellClick = 0 Then $g_pAuiDispCellClick = __AUI_RegisterCallback("__AUI_CellClickProxy", "hwnd;int;int;int")
	If $sFuncName <> "" And $g_pAuiDispCellClick = 0 Then Return SetError(@error, 0, 0)
