; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: Buttons are drawn virtually by DataView and no child elements are created; dangerous operations such as
;                  deletion should explicitly set the Danger variant.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_DataViewGetColumnActions, _UI_DataViewSetColumnActionVariant, _UI_DataViewOnAction
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
