; 說明 ...: Queries whether all existing rows in a non-empty DataView are checked.
; 語法 ........: _UI_DataViewIsAllChecked( $hWnd, $iDataView )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iDataView - DataView element ID returned by _UI_DataView
; 傳回值 .: Success - True means all non-empty views are checked; False means not all are checked or the view is empty.
;                  Failure - False
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_DataViewSetAllChecked, _UI_DataViewGetCheckedCount
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
