; 說明 ...: Queries whether the specified context menu item is enabled.
; 語法 ........: _UI_ContextMenuGetItemEnabled( $hWnd, $iMenu, $iIndex )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iMenu - ContextMenu control ID
;                  $iIndex - Zero-based menu-item index
; 傳回值 .: Success - 1 = enabled, 0 = disabled
;                  Failure - 0, and set the error code
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_ContextMenuSetItemEnabled
