; #FUNCTION# ===================================================================================================================
; 名稱 ..........: _UI_WebViewGetAttributeAsync
; 說明 ...: Asynchronously reads the attributes of the specified matching element.
; 語法 ........: _UI_WebViewGetAttributeAsync( $hWnd, $iWebId, $sMode, $sSel, $sName, $iIndex = 0, $sOnDone = "" )
; 參數 ....: $hWnd - Window handle returned by _UI_WindowCreate
;                  $iWebId - WebView control ID (_UI_WebView returned)
;                  $sMode - Locator type; must be "css" or "xpath"
;                  $sSel - Non-empty CSS selector or XPath expression
;                  $sName - Non-empty attribute name
