; 傳回值 .: Success 1, Failure 0
; 作者 ........: Fanxing
; 備註 .......: AUI enables foreign-key enforcement on new connections by default. Do not disable it temporarily to bypass
;                  data integrity.
; 相關函式 .......: _UI_DbForeignKeysGet
; 範例 .......: Yes
; ===============================================================================================================================
Func _UI_DbForeignKeysSet($iDatabase, $bEnabled)
    Local $vAuiForwardResult = __AUI_Call("int", "_UI_DbForeignKeysSet", "uint64", $iDatabase, "int", $bEnabled ? 1 : 0)
